<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Hiring Announcement</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .header-logo {
    float: left;
    width: 100px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .header-info {
    float: right;
    width: 100px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .two-column {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .two-column > div {
    width: 48%;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <img src="" alt="Seal" class="header-logo">
    <img src="" alt="Seal" class="header-info">
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">Commonwealth Healthcare Corporation</h1>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Commonwealth of the Northern Mariana Islands</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">P. O. Box {{ postal_address }}; Saipan, MP {{ zip_code }}</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Website: <a href="#">{{ website }}</a></p>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">HUMAN RESOURCES</h2>

  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">EXAMINATION ANNOUNCEMENT NO. {{ announcement_number }}</h3>

  <div class="two-column">
    <div>
      <p>POSITION: <span data-field="position_title">{{ position_title }}</span></p>
      <p>NO. OF VACANCIES: <span data-field="number_of_vacancies">{{ number_of_vacancies }}</span></p>
      <p>SALARY: <span data-field="salary_range">{{ salary_range }}</span></p>
      <p>LOCATION: <span data-field="location">{{ location }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>OPENING DATE: <span data-field="opening_date">{{ opening_date }}</span></p>
      <p>CLOSING DATE: <span data-field="closing_date">{{ closing_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <h3 class="section-title">POSITION SUMMARY:</h3>
  <p>{{ position_summary }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">DUTIES:</h3>
  <p>{{ duties_description }}</p>

  <p>Use clinical and laboratory data to support epidemiological activities. Evaluates the ongoing improvement in laboratory testing capability for infectious diseases and develop the capabilities with HIS to help ensure program sustainability in collaboration with the CHCC Lab Director and the CHCC</p>

  <p>CHCC is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants for all positions without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, mental or veteran status, the presence of a non-job related medical condition or disability, or any legal protected status.</p>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <h3 class="section-title">Epidemiologic Investigations.</h3>
  <p>{{ epi_investigations_description }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">Surveillance Activities.</h3>
  <p>{{ surveillance_activities_description }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">Epidemiologic Consultation on Scientific and Technical Issues.</h3>
  <p>{{ epi_consultation_description }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">Development and Dissemination of Data and Epidemiologic Findings.</h3>
  <p>{{ data_dissemination_description }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">Performance of other duties as assigned or as required.</h3>
  <p>{{ other_duties_description }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">QUALIFICATION REQUIREMENTS:</h3>
  <p>{{ qualification_requirements }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">CONDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:</h3>
  <p>{{ conditional_requirements }}</p>

  <h3 class="section-title">OTHERS:</h3>
  <p>{{ others_description }}</p>

  <p>CHCC is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants for all positions without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, mental or veteran status, the presence of a non-job related medical condition or disability, or any legal protected status.</p>

  <div class="divider" style="margin-top: 50px;"></div>

  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">INTERESTED PERSONS SHOULD SEND THEIR CURRENT APPLICATION FORMS TO:</h3>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Office of Human Resources</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Commonwealth Healthcare Corporation</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">1 Lower Navy Hill Road, Navy Hill, Saipan, MP {{ zip_code }}</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Employment Application Forms will be available 24/7 at the employer's hospital facility's Main Cashier Office (entrance/exit point for all)</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Direct Line: {{ direct_line }}</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Trunk Line: {{ trunk_line }}</p>
  <p style="text-align: center;">Fax Line: {{ fax_line }}</p>

  <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">CHCC is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants for all positions without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, mental or veteran status, the presence of a non-job related medical condition or disability, or any legal protected status.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>